<spell-notebook "items theming">
	<header level="1">
		Items
		<header>A group of items presents a set of site content for display, each an image beside its
              text.</>
	</>
	<items-tab-bar showing="theming"/>
	<section>
		<menu class="ui-docs-section-tabs" appearance="segmented" aria-label="Sections">
			<item link="#tokens">Tokens</>
			<item link="#themes">Themes</>
		</>
	</>

	<!-- THEMING:  the family's tokens, live, plus how to set them and which themes touch it. -->
	<section label="Tokens">
		<markdown>
			Theme with the public `--ui-items-*` tokens: set one on the element, on any ancestor (a region, `:root`), or on
			the group's box through `::part(items)`. The items inside read them from the group, so set them there or above,
			not on one item.
		</>
		<markdown>
			```css
			ui-items {
			  --ui-items-image-width: 8em;
			  --ui-items-divided-border: 2px solid var(--ui-border-color);
			}
			```
		</>
		<message state="info" size="small">
			<markdown>
				`divided`, `spacing`, `appearance` and `unstackable` switch private tokens the items read; use the attributes, and
				never set the `--_ui-*` / `--_items-*` names: they're the sheet's private plumbing.
			</>
		</>
		<markdown>Edit a value below to try it.</>
		<html>
			<ui-docs-tokens family="ui-items" playground>
				<ui-items>
					<ui-item>
						<ui-image alt="" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 width=%22480%22 height=%22320%22 viewBox=%220 0 30 20%22%3E%3Crect width=%2230%22 height=%2220%22 fill=%22%23cbd5e1%22/%3E%3Cpath d=%22M3 17l7-8 5 6 4-4 8 6z%22 fill=%22%2394a3b8%22/%3E%3Ccircle cx=%2222%22 cy=%226%22 r=%222%22 fill=%22%2394a3b8%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E"></>
						<ui-content>
							<ui-header link="#cute-dog">Cute Dog</>
							<ui-meta>
								<ui-text>Description</>
							</>
							<ui-description>
								<ui-text paragraph>Many people also have their own barometers for what makes a cute dog.</>
							</>
							<ui-extra>Additional details</>
						</>
					</>
					<ui-item>
						<ui-image alt="" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 width=%22480%22 height=%22320%22 viewBox=%220 0 30 20%22%3E%3Crect width=%2230%22 height=%2220%22 fill=%22%23cbd5e1%22/%3E%3Cpath d=%22M3 17l7-8 5 6 4-4 8 6z%22 fill=%22%2394a3b8%22/%3E%3Ccircle cx=%2222%22 cy=%226%22 r=%222%22 fill=%22%2394a3b8%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E"></>
						<ui-content>
							<ui-header link="#arrowhead-valley-camp">Arrowhead Valley Camp</>
							<ui-meta>
								<ui-text>$1200 1 month</>
							</>
							<ui-description>
								<ui-text paragraph>Ours is a life of constant reruns.</>
							</>
							<ui-extra>Limited availability</>
						</>
					</>
				</>
			</>
		</>
	</>

	<section label="Themes">
		<markdown>
			The theme menu above picks the theme for every page of the site:  Spell, Glass, Fruity or Merlot,
			each restyling this component through its tokens.
		</>
	</>
</spell-notebook>
